            <div xml:id="m-689dd90a-f574-449a-a862-742fe3b7fa04">
              <lg xml:id="m-f1722815-cad1-4ca4-adc9-f4edc99c961e">
                <l xml:id="m-67f8a5bb-adea-417b-8ac9-3c65d6a64c08" facs="#m-97a8fc91-5703-48de-a25d-2fa00e413492" label="text-like">4Sunday within the Octave of the Sacred Heart.</l><l xml:id="m-ca611557-6bda-4b82-bc78-83109219af88" facs="#m-75a31d6c-0baa-41ce-9edb-7cf5fa5dc493" label="lyrics-like">oblí- tus</l><l xml:id="m-c9a5abca-e460-4319-93bd-950394beab6a" facs="#m-c6b97d73-0b0a-43ca-ac1b-936bfb08affd" label="lyrics-like">ora-ti-6- nem páupe-rum.</l><l xml:id="m-d3fc20d2-6dad-447d-9495-cd3929dcb149" facs="#m-fcebe586-7775-42e2-a3b8-cf6389eb94f9" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-56313adc-8643-4f7a-9db4-77cfdb3b9de7" facs="#m-667d49d0-7651-4fd4-941a-593c8ee81498" label="lyrics-like">?Espice, Dómine, múnera suppli¬ suménda concéde. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-d7662039-e3e8-43ee-a79e-01b7fdbc7324" facs="#m-729643ab-202c-4fea-a9d6-c847b3fdfc23" label="lyrics-like">1t cántis Ecclésiae: et salúti cre- nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-97a44089-689f-4b73-9380-8682f61e5650" facs="#m-ed2fba4a-ea70-48ed-b51f-44ce1bbbe850" label="lyrics-like">déntium perpétua sanctificatióne</l><l xml:id="m-9cc67e02-949d-4b7e-8994-31bb89dcd9a0" facs="#m-3780c32f-def8-43d2-83dd-d5674403914e" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Octave. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-9d060d0b-0dad-49cc-9155-fbcb4212e144" facs="#m-791dfdf3-d2d3-4d5b-be5d-455943253290" label="lyrics-like">DEspice, quaésumus Dómine, ad! sit tibi munus accéptum et nostró¬</l><l xml:id="m-9942d02a-c472-4707-b45b-6c4312725729" facs="#m-0a7e7143-664a-48c7-8fc1-ccc65db355dd" label="lyrics-like">Lt ineffábilem Cordis dilécti Fili ] rum expiátio delictórum. Per eúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f240d73-2e4b-458f-96ea-99375ce5c449" facs="#m-544a1a68-9135-45a3-ade0-04fca1dbfb1c" label="lyrics-like">tui caritátem: ut quod offérimus! dem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7e67a6bf-f013-43aa-9175-8273f86e80d5" facs="#m-d6dfb82b-73d3-46bf-b2eb-073a9fe8b412" label="text-like">Preface of the Sacred Heart, p. 0.</l><l xml:id="m-eb34af40-c3e8-40c3-8ccf-9e7d26ca6745" facs="#m-ea408ab8-dce0-4e25-bf97-29cf68f09978" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-55fce37a-f11a-4bd1-a4da-b9686335c50b" facs="#m-a3a3296d-20da-4b2c-89a0-4183f5cc89b8" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-d35d21df-aed0-471e-bb33-da7736a00225" facs="#m-d7a32a24-3128-400f-aab1-347607fd8df0" label="lyrics-like">DIco vóbis, “ gáudi-um est Ange-lis Dé- i super</l><l xml:id="m-20ae47a8-33fc-4688-9d0c-542a1bd10ebc" facs="#m-77c12c23-366c-46e8-8207-6e731690eff3" label="lyrics-like">úno pecca-tó-re paeni-ténti-am</l><l xml:id="m-d12c94e2-de03-45a1-9a15-a0cd062510c5" facs="#m-a5a4f565-40dc-4178-866d-b59f8ac3221e" label="lyrics-like">agénte.</l><l xml:id="m-7f35c1ef-11a8-41ce-9cc3-bd3196e40de3" facs="#m-4aa32da1-4a17-4597-9fce-8a2103492220" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b1c4e614-585e-44d0-8800-6b964cf68b72" facs="#m-7b760cae-828d-4c79-98b7-a1cee71f11f8" label="lyrics-like">Ancta tua nos, Dómine, sumpta! sempitérnae praéparent expiátos.</l><l xml:id="m-f9fab093-bbba-486d-8659-4fd0adbc239e" facs="#m-d5610068-a3c2-494c-8c3e-096571f3ce07" label="lyrics-like">S vivificent: et misericórdiae! Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-b47278a2-6198-47a5-aef8-433c53d1ace7" facs="#m-a9a99f38-c8d9-4654-94ff-98d9d4fb3040" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Octave. Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-dfa6444a-9663-4462-b609-0cc9045d6f08" facs="#m-9143b845-244f-4397-851e-2eff107933e1" label="lyrics-like">Raébeant nobis, Dómine Jesu, ] percépta, discámus terréna despí¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6cc772a-2e91-4e55-9a18-cfbe9494e009" facs="#m-cc098335-5501-499b-9122-cdd7e31d1ca4" label="lyrics-like">divínum tua sancta fervórem; ]cere, et amáre caeléstia: Qui vivis</l><l xml:id="m-3e9ded52-e6dd-4c8a-9191-95a5cc8bcf90" facs="#m-54645413-e2a6-42df-8202-44285b6a1770" label="lyrics-like">quo dulcíssimi Cordis tui suavitáte! et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-a69d4e36-cbd0-475f-951c-7622a76b5565" facs="#m-8a017fbc-400d-495c-96fa-626f5ac3385f" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-68274a0c-4a94-4a8d-9253-94ccd959bdd0" facs="#m-b8d03256-961d-43a0-a49f-7e2da4c1b1ad" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-459aa292-bf17-4e3c-a082-959dd6fc5189" facs="#m-545cb7b1-9a95-49a3-84af-5c686fc69de5" label="ambiguous">1. Petr. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-67e09823-a86e-4cdb-8133-d59461d18e52" facs="#m-f4d4862f-44a1-4405-9d6a-a2a9359eb85b" label="lyrics-like">Yobrii estóte et vigiláte, quia ad- fide,“sciéntes eámdem passiónem</l><l xml:id="m-3d8292b1-28fb-40bb-9c9f-565edfeade20" facs="#m-b5aed7ef-4f2b-470e-849e-2c04fc97e025" label="lyrics-like">O versárius vester diábolus tam¬</l><l xml:id="m-9382588a-faf5-4e37-9096-94640994386c" facs="#m-c3f7f30d-47d8-4cb5-abaf-cbd7156ec1f6" label="ambiguous">ei, quae in mundo est, vestrae</l><l xml:id="m-9e5571cb-5ec4-407a-9a9e-3bb1a0da301c" facs="#m-341b9717-c62e-4197-b31e-12af8a078fc9" label="lyrics-like">fraternitáti fieri.</l><l xml:id="m-389f0f8b-83c1-45f5-b2d7-dfa97e13a079" facs="#m-c77813a2-5276-4331-b2dd-030113b6f267" label="lyrics-like">quam leo rúgiens circuit, quaerens</l><l xml:id="m-aa6e3e7e-12dc-41f4-8451-53ad91ede5c5" facs="#m-4ac90222-db62-4192-85de-89821f46c288" label="lyrics-like">quem dévoret, f cui resístite fortes in</l><l xml:id="m-53ad547e-cdb9-4cd7-a979-703c51b0665e" facs="#m-f0ef0bf1-ef28-49c0-a92e-c6178de0da8d" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Ego díxi, Dómine. p. 976.</l><l xml:id="m-a6933171-0d46-4659-8b46-ee0e3c411dd8" facs="#m-b33179a6-9a0d-433d-baba-e6bdc66a5789" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-7337ea74-1606-42b7-b700-0d7d2c427f31" facs="#m-8b8e084a-2b0a-4433-ae7b-de32b4c95742" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-dda1df11-eee5-4d9b-9525-eb082f75a5e7" facs="#m-a9f5d14c-861b-433a-927e-61c68cc16bbc" label="ambiguous">1. Petr. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-f7249d16-77f6-4f58-84cf-89fbb0517c98" facs="#m-ca353126-e794-4d22-877d-4eaf1b152b16" label="lyrics-like">Eus autem omnis grátiae, qui passos ipse perficiet, confirmábit</l><l xml:id="m-32e75576-e77c-4c46-ba0b-3f7d0b098582" facs="#m-c2597786-5818-4345-8f4f-c65e6e519f1f" label="lyrics-like">U vocávit nos in aetérnam suam solidabitque. * Ipsi glória et impé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5a7e541-cd48-4e98-961a-0bd5b16d8d67" facs="#m-178e643d-3983-42aa-bfad-12c34b1b8780" label="lyrics-like">glóriam in Christo Jesu, f módicum ] rium in saécula saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-a37aae6b-a384-491c-b603-a45d371eb985" facs="#m-e4f9e622-0b53-42d2-8d80-a9e1536a5c13" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Memóriam fécit. p. 976.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
